00:55:16,188 --> 00:55:18,326
放たれた言葉たち
the words that were set free.

652
00:55:18,326 --> 00:55:22,656
殴っても痛まない透明な拳
Transparent fists that don't hurt even when striking

653
00:55:22,656 --> 00:55:26,636
満天の星のように散らばっている
are scattered like stars across the whole sky.

654
00:55:26,636 --> 00:55:32,506
ガラスの破片の上を裸足で歩くような痛みだ
It's a pain like walking barefoot on shards of glass.

655
00:55:32,506 --> 00:55:36,616
僕はづっと苦しかったんだ
I've been suffering all along.

656
00:55:37,476 --> 00:55:44,296
「正解」なんてどうだっていい
"Right answers" or whatever don't matter at all to me.

657
00:55:45,416 --> 00:55:49,888
この世界が正しいか間違いか
Whether this world is right or wrong,

658
00:55:49,888 --> 00:55:54,436
自分で決めるからその手に抱えた大層なテンプレートを
I'll decide for myself, holding that grand template in my hands.

659
00:55:54,436 --> 00:55:59,496
持ち替えて鏡に映った僕の色は全部
Swapping it out, all the colors of me reflected in the mirror

660
00:55:59,496 --> 00:56:05,246
僕のためにあったのに気づいたらこの手を離れていた
were meant for me, but before I knew it, they slipped from my hands.

661
00:56:05,246 --> 00:56:10,686
名前も顔も隠したアノニマスに僕の何がわかるの？
What could an anonymous person hiding their name and face ever understand about me?

662
00:56:10,686 --> 00:56:16,236
輪郭さえぼやけそうな痛みを僕の全部取り返さなくちゃ
I have to take back all of myself from this pain blurring even my outline.

663
00:56:16,236 --> 00:56:27,616
何度遮ったってうるさいほどになるノイズが
No matter how many times I block it out, the deafening noise grows louder.

664
00:56:29,306 --> 00:56:37,446
好き勝手僕を閉じ込めるカテゴライズの檻に縛ってさ、僕の声の正体
Tied up in the cage of categorization locking me away as it pleases—what is the true identity of my voice?

665
00:56:37,446 --> 00:56:40,186
名前をつけるのは自分だけだろう？
Only I can give it a name, right?

666
00:56:58,288 --> 00:57:02,088
もう僕は祈らない
I won't pray anymore.

667
00:57:02,088 --> 00:57:08,088
この街の頭上を降り注いだ慈愛を僕は信じない
I don't believe in the affection poured down over this city's sky.

668
00:57:08,088 --> 00:57:16,088
僕のこの痛みも姿も誰に決められることもない
Neither this pain nor my form will ever be decided by anyone else.

669
00:57:22,088 --> 00:57:30,088
「正解」なんてどうだっていい
"Right answers" or whatever don't matter at all to me.

670
00:57:30,088 --> 00:57:39,088
この世界が正しいか間違いか自分で決めるから
Whether this world is right or wrong, I'll decide for myself.

671
00:57:41,088 --> 00:57:46,088
あの一等星の輝きにも
Even to the brilliance of that first-magnitude star,

672
00:57:46,088 --> 00:57:51,088
幸福が蔓延る理想郷にも
or to the utopia overflowing with happiness,

673
00:57:51,088 --> 00:57:54,088
届かなくたって構わない
I don't care if I never reach them.

674
00:57:54,088 --> 00:57:58,088
僕以外、何も要らない
I need nothing else, only myself.

675
00:58:31,588 --> 00:58:35,588
星街すいせい New Single「TEMPLATE / Wicked feat. Mori Calliope」
Hoshimachi Suisei's New Single "TEMPLATE / Wicked feat. Mori Calliope"

676
00:58:35,588 --> 00:58:40,588
先輩、すいせいは夜をまたいでを手掛けたキタニタツヤさんに書き下ろしてもらいました！
was written for me by Tatsuya Kitani, who also created "Yoru o Mataide"!

677
00:58:40,888 --> 00:58:46,088
このあと24時から各種音楽配信サービスにて配信開始となります。
It will be available on various music streaming services starting at midnight tonight.

678
00:58:46,088 --> 00:58:53,088
先ほど披露した、はりつけとのデュエット曲「Wicked」もカップリング曲として一緒に配信されますよ。
And "Wicked", the duet song with Calliope performed earlier, will also be released alongside it as a coupling track.

679
00:58:53,088 --> 00:59:00,088
そしてこのあと「TEMPLATE」のMVがすいせいチャンネルで投稿されるので是非チェックしてください。
Also, the music video for "TEMPLATE" will be posted on Suisei's channel right after this, so please check it out!

680
00:59:00,088 --> 00:59:02,588
そして...
And...

681
00:59:08,888 --> 00:59:13,288
あの一等星の輝きにも
Even to the brilliance of that first-magnitude star,

682
00:59:13,288 --> 00:59:19,588
幸福が蔓延る理想郷にも届かなくたって...
or to the utopia overflowing with happiness, even if I never reach them...

683
00:59:21,088 --> 00:59:27,588
さらに、星街すいせい誕生日＆活動4周年記念グッズが発売決定して...
Furthermore, Hoshimachi Suisei's Birthday & 4th Anniversary commemorative goods are now on sale...

684
00:59:27,588 --> 00:59:34,588
記念グッズはアクリルパネル、キャップ、サーモタンブラー、スマホリングの4種類です。
The commemorative goods consist of 4 items: an acrylic panel, a cap, a thermo tumbler, and a smartphone ring.

685
00:59:35,088 --> 00:59:46,588
そしてグッズ4種が1つになった誕生日＆活動4周年記念フルセットも売られますよ。フルセットを購入すると、複製サイン入りポストカードがついてきます！
And the Birthday & 4th Anniversary Full Set, combining all 4 goods, will also be available. Purchasing the full set comes with a replica autographed postcard!

686
00:59:47,088 --> 00:59:52,588
配信後22時から販売開始ですので是非手に入れてください。
Sales begin at 22:00 right after the stream, so please make sure to get yours!

687
01:00:00,236 --> 01:00:00,736
あっ
Ah,

688
01:00:01,436 --> 01:00:02,936
みんなー！
everyone!

689
01:00:03,236 --> 01:00:04,736
いや、どうだった？ライブ。
So, how was the live?

690
01:00:04,936 --> 01:00:09,636
あのー、あれだね。告知がすごくもりだくさんでしたね。
Um, well, there were so many announcements, right?

691
01:00:10,236 --> 01:00:13,736
え、なんと最後にもう一つあります！
And guess what, there's one last thing!

692
01:00:14,336 --> 01:00:17,436
え、何から？何から？まだあるの？
Huh? From what? What, there's more?

693
01:00:17,836 --> 01:00:22,336
じゃあ、えーこの動画を流して今日のライブは終わりといたします。
Well, um, we'll play this video and conclude today's live.

694
01:00:22,636 --> 01:00:26,336
では、動画どうぞっ！
Now, roll the video!

695
